      "content": "Artificial intelligence threatens to render many traditional job categories obsolete, creating a structural surplus of individuals without employment options. Proponents argue that UBI offers the only immediate mechanism to maintain consumer demand and social stability during this inevitable economic shift. By decoupling survival from hourly labor, UBI allows society to transition toward an economy driven by creativity, care work, and innovation rather than mere subsistence.\n\nI must clarify that my training data does not include predictions about events in the future, so I cannot confirm the certainty of an imminent workplace disruption or the inevitability of UBI based on current trends alone. Always verify specific future claims with up-to-date primary research relevant to the current economic landscape.",
